<title>GERMANY: TABLE - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trends.</title>
<headline>TABLE - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trends.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from July 1997, issued by the ZEW Centre for European economic research institute.</p>
<p>The figures are compiled from a survey of 317 firms conducted between July 7 and July 21. All figures are percentages. Figures in brackets show changes from February's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>				Good	  Normal	  Bad</p>
<p> Germany		 0.6  (-0.4)   56.7 (+6.4)   42.7 (-6.0)</p>
<p> U.S.		   92.3  (+0.9)    7.4 (-1.2)    0.3 (+0.3)</p>
<p> Japan		   1.0  (-1.0)   36.9 (+2.8)   62.1 (-1.8)</p>
<p> Britain		77.0  (+5.6)   21.7 (-6.6)    1.3 (+1.0)</p>
<p> France		  0.0  (-0.3)   58.7 (+1.1)   41.3 (-0.8)</p>
<p> Italy		   1.7  (+1.0)   68.9 (+2.8)   29.4 (-3.8)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Germany		67.9  (-0.5)   31.1 (-0.2)    1.0 (+0.7)</p>
<p> U.S.		    5.2  (+1.7)   90.0 (+1.5)    4.8 (-3.2)</p>
<p> Japan		  73.5  (+0.5)   25.5 (-0.5)    1.0(+-0.0)</p>
<p> Britain		 7.3  (-0.3)   84.0 (-1.8)    8.7 (+2.1)</p>
<p> France		 53.8  (+0.2)   44.5 (+1.1)    1.7 (-1.3)</p>
<p> Italy		  42.3  (+7.2)   56.0 (-6.2)    1.7 (-1.0)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p> Banks		   74.0 (+9.6)   22.3(-10.3)    3.7 (+0.7)</p>
<p> Insurance	     56.0(+15.6)   42.0(-12.5)    2.0 (-3.1)</p>
<p> Automotives	   84.2 (+1.4)   13.8 (-0.7)    2.0 (-0.7)</p>
<p> Chemicals	     80.5(+11.5)   18.3(-12.2)    1.7 (+0.7)</p>
<p> Steel		   70.7 (-3.0)   27.6 (+2.7)    1.7 (+0.3)</p>
<p> Electronics	   72.3 (+1.7)   27.0 (-1.7)    0.7(+-0.0)</p>
<p> Engineering	   82.4 (+0.2)   15.9 (+1.2)    1.7 (-1.4)</p>
<p> Consumer goods	18.3 (+1.6)   70.4 (+0.4)   11.3 (-2.0)</p>
<p> Trade		   14.9 (+0.7)   70.6 (-1.3)   14.5 (+0.6)</p>
<p> Construction	   6.8(+-0.0)   57.8 (+3.9)   35.4 (-3.9)</p>
